        "original_id": "9a5937be-6737-5dcf-891d-8c8d04bd2e65",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mick Napier, Stephen Colbert, Tina Fey, Rachel Dratch, Horatio Sanz, Nia Vardalos, Andy Richter, Jeff Garlin, David Sedaris\n- Products: The Colbert Report, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert, Splatter Theatre\n- Organizations: Comedy Central, CBS\n- Places: Cabaret Metro\n\nFacts:\n- On October 31, 1987, Splatter Theatre was first performed at the Cabaret Metro, and Mick Napier directed the show.\n- Mick Napier has directed performers including Stephen Colbert, Tina Fey, Rachel Dratch, Horatio Sanz, Nia Vardalos, Andy Richter, Jeff Garlin, and David Sedaris.\n- Stephen Colbert hosted the satirical Comedy Central program The Colbert Report from 2005 to 2014.\n- Stephen Colbert began hosting the CBS talk program The Late Show with Stephen Colbert in September 2015.",
